2026-10-28T17:23:13.5839497Z {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FBS5k3At2NsBzKiHqmcs8A","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"issue\": {\n    \"number\": 14,\n    \"title\": \"[Bug]: aws_bedrockagent_data_source: connector_parameters plans a whitespace-only update when the service stores the JSON in another key order\",\n    \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n    \"labels_at_open\": []\n  },\n  \"as_of\": \"2026-09-17T21:34:33+00:00\",\n  \"form\": {\n    \"template\": \"Report a Bug\",\n    \"missing_required\": [\n      \"Sample Terraform Configuration\"\n    ],\n    \"empty_optional\": [],\n    \"used_form\": true\n  },\n  \"services\": {\n    \"resources_mentioned\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"aws_bedrockagent_data_source\",\n        \"resource_exists\": true,\n        \"data_source_exists\": false,\n        \"service_label\": \"service/bedrockagent\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"aws_iam_policy\",\n        \"resource_exists\": true,\n        \"data_source_exists\": true,\n        \"service_label\": \"service/iam\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"aws_bedrockagent_knowledge_base\",\n        \"resource_exists\": true,\n        \"data_source_exists\": false,\n        \"service_label\": \"service/bedrockagent\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"aws_secretsmanager_secret\",\n        \"resource_exists\": true,\n        \"data_source_exists\": true,\n        \"service_label\": \"service/secretsmanager\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"regex_labeler_would_apply\": [\n      \"bug\",\n      \"service/bedrockagent\"\n    ],\n    \"primary_service_label\": \"service/bedrockagent\"\n  },\n  \"versions\": {\n    \"terraform\": \"1.16.1\",\n    \"provider\": \"6.64.0\",\n    \"latest_release\": \"6.65.0\",\n    \"latest_release_date\": \"2026-09-16\",\n    \"provider_status\": \"current\",\n    \"minor_releases_behind\": 1,\n    \"newer_release_notes\": [\n      {\n        \"version\": \"6.65.0\",\n        \"date\": \"2026-09-16\",\n        \"note\": \"resource/aws_secretsmanager_secret: Fix removal of all `replica` blocks not being detected as a change ([#39235](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws/issues/39235))\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"version\": \"6.65.0\",\n        \"date\": \"2026-09-16\",\n        \"note\": \"resource/aws_bedrockagent_data_source: Change `data_source_configuration.managed_knowledge_base_connector_configuration.deletion_protection_configuration.deletion_protection_threshold` to Optional and Computed ([#49977](\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"newer_fixes\": [\n      \"6.65.0\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"similar_issues\": [\n    {\n      \"number\": 49888,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#49888\",\n      \"title\": \"[Enhancement]: aws_bedrockagent_data_source \\u2014 support sync_schedule on managed_knowledge_base_connector_configuration\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"aws_bedrockagent_data_source gained the data_source_configuration.managed_knowledge_base_connector_configuration block in #48904, exposing connector_parameters, deletion_protection_configuration, and media_extraction_configuration. The Bedrock API's ManagedKnowledgeBaseConnectorConfiguration also has a SyncSchedule member (a sibling of ConnectorParameters) that sets the recurring schedule on which\",\n      \"state\": \"open\",\n      \"state_reason\": null,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-09-08T08:45:57Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.211,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": 49959,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#49959\",\n      \"title\": \"[Bug]: aws_bedrockagent_data_source \\u2014 perpetual diff on deletion_protection_threshold for managed connector\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"When managed_knowledge_base_connector_configuration.deletion_protection_configuration is set with only deletion_protection_status (no deletion_protection_threshold), AWS returns a default deletion_protection_threshold of 15. Because the value is not reflec