2026-10-28T17:23:34.2853570Z   
2026-10-28T17:23:34.2854668Z   - **Why a comment:** the issue is a bug report on provider v6.64.0, and v6.65.0 has a fix note for `aws_bedrockagent_data_source`. The comment asks the reporter to check whether it still happens on v6.65.0 and to add the output if it does. It doesn't say the release fixes the problem.
2026-10-28T17:23:34.2856013Z   - **Labels:** the regex labeler will already add `bug` and `service/bedrockagent`, so I added only `waiting-response`.
2026-10-28T17:23:34.2857681Z   - **Fix-note match:** the v6.65.0 note is about `deletion_protection_threshold`, not the `connector_parameters` diff reported here. The skill's rule only requires a fix note for a resource the issue names, so I followed it. A maintainer may find the comment is a weaker fit than it looks.
2026-10-28T17:23:34.2859267Z   - **Form check:** the check flagged "Sample Terraform Configuration" as missing, but the issue does include a configuration, under a different heading. I didn't ask for it.
2026-10-28T17:23:34.2860176Z   - **Duplicates:** none of the similar earlier issues was a likely or possible duplicate.
